[{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0415","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0415.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-0747","title":"IBM AIX lsmcode 本地缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"IBM AIX 4.3.3 及 4.3.x/5.1 版本中的 lsmcode 工具存在本地缓冲区溢出漏洞。攻击者可通过设置超长 LSMCODE 环境变量触发缓冲区溢出，覆盖内存中的关键数据，从而以 root 权限执行任意代码。该漏洞需要攻击者拥有本地系统访问权限，CVSS 评分 10.0，危害等级严重。IBM 已发布安全补丁修复此漏洞。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-2002-0747"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2002-08-12T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:58:03Z","remediation":"建议立即安装 IBM APAR IY27708 补丁，或升级至 AIX 5.2 及以上版本。如无法打补丁，可执行 `chmod 500 /usr/sbin/lsmcode` 移除 setuid 位，或通过 `rm /usr/sbin/lsmcode` 删除该非必要工具作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/aix/2002-q2/0005.html","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/22756","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/2e429c9a0087eb0ee678d77c344076eb39564d19/cves/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0747.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/37abbcb2a8225ed14d2b9dfffb1ad41b15cc2cc8/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-0747.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-0747","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2002/CVE-2002-0747.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67ac35/nvdcve/CVE-2002-0747.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/3a7c0c4aa01967d2633d808f80f3fcd65491b947/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-07xx/CVE-2002-0747.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/14d874e761633e61e3b45458431a87e35478bd2b/2002/CVE-2002-0747.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/67c5e994e49225faeedb88198d627dbdd922374c/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0747.md","https://github.com/aquasecurity/vuln-list-nvd/blob/ef57640f19da1737a8612e28839821eee8a753b5/api/2002/CVE-2002-0747.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0747.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2002/POC-AVE-2002-0415.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2002/EXP-AVE-2002-0415.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0415.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0412","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0412.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-0741","title":"Psychoid psyBNC 超大密码拒绝服务漏洞","description":"psyBNC 2.3 存在拒绝服务漏洞，远程攻击者可通过向 PASS 命令提交超长密码参数并迅速断开连接，导致 psyBNC 无法正确终止该连接，从而引发 CPU 资源耗尽和服务不可用。该漏洞影响 psyBNC 2.3 版本，攻击者无需认证即可远程触发，危害等级中等。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2002-0741"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2002-08-12T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:58:02Z","remediation":"升级 psyBNC 至 2.3.1 或更高版本，该版本已修复 PASS 命令超长密码导致的资源耗尽问题。如无法升级，可修改源码限制 PASS 参数长度不超过 128 字符后重新编译。网络层面可在防火墙上限制 psyBNC 端口（默认 6667）仅允许可信 IP 访问。鉴于 psyBNC 已停止维护，建议迁移至 ZNC 等仍在维护的 IRC 代理软件。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2002-04/0322.html","http://online.securityfocus.com/archive/1/269131","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/8912.php","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/4570","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/21409","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/2e429c9a0087eb0ee678d77c344076eb39564d19/cves/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0741.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/37abbcb2a8225ed14d2b9dfffb1ad41b15cc2cc8/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-0741.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-0741","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2002/CVE-2002-0741.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67ac35/nvdcve/CVE-2002-0741.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/14d874e761633e61e3b45458431a87e35478bd2b/2002/CVE-2002-0741.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/67c5e994e49225faeedb88198d627dbdd922374c/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0741.md","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/3a7c0c4aa01967d2633d808f80f3fcd65491b947/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-07xx/CVE-2002-0741.json","https://github.com/cristianovisk/cves_data_intelligence/blob/06e08620f3a759469f608945f3059c05cc640333/social_media/x/2002/CVE-2002-0741.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0741.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0412.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0409","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0409.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-0737","title":"Sambar Sambar Server 脚本源代码泄露漏洞","description":"Sambar Web Server 5.2 beta 1 之前版本存在脚本源代码泄露漏洞。远程攻击者可通过向服务器发送以空格和空字符结尾的特制 URL，利用 DOS 设备名称（如 CON、NUL 等）触发该漏洞，导致服务器端脚本（如 .asp、.pl 等）源代码被直接泄露，或造成拒绝服务（资源耗尽）。攻击无需身份认证，通过网络即可远程利用，危害中等。该漏洞已有公开 PoC 可利用。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.4,"aliases":["CVE-2002-0737"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2002-08-12T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:58:02Z","remediation":"升级 Sambar Server 至 5.2 beta 1 或更高版本，该版本修复了通过 URL 末尾添加空格和空字符绕过脚本源码保护的问题。如无法升级，可在 Web 服务器前端部署反向代理（如 Nginx），过滤包含空字节（%00）的畸形请求 URL。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/vulnwatch/2002-q2/0026.html","http://online.securityfocus.com/archive/1/268121","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/8876.php","http://www.osvdb.org/5123","http://www.sambar.com/security.htm","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/4533","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/21390","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/2e429c9a0087eb0ee678d77c344076eb39564d19/cves/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0737.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-0737","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/37abbcb2a8225ed14d2b9dfffb1ad41b15cc2cc8/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-0737.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2002/CVE-2002-0737.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67ac35/nvdcve/CVE-2002-0737.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/e8a327b5fb8f10386ada774358fd16a706ab4c88/2002/CVE-2002-0737.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/67c5e994e49225faeedb88198d627dbdd922374c/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0737.md","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/3a7c0c4aa01967d2633d808f80f3fcd65491b947/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-07xx/CVE-2002-0737.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0737.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/2ea9851780633b2caab16fe048a14b38ca9a0b56/content/CVE-2002-0737.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0409.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0407","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0407.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-0734","title":"B2 b2edit.showposts.php 远程文件包含漏洞","description":"B2 2.0.6pre2 及更早版本中 b2edit.showposts.php 文件存在远程文件包含漏洞。该漏洞源于程序在特定配置下未能正确加载 b2config.php 文件，导致 $b2inc 变量可被外部控制。远程攻击者无需身份认证即可通过构造恶意 URL 向 $b2inc 参数传入指向远程服务器上恶意程序的地址，从而在目标服务器上执行任意 PHP 代码，实现完全控制服务器、窃取数据或进行横向渗透。攻击复杂度低，仅需网络访问即可触发。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2002-0734"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2002-08-12T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:58:02Z","remediation":"B2 已停止维护多年，建议立即迁移至 WordPress 等持续更新的博客平台。若暂时无法迁移，可手动修改 b2edit.showposts.php 文件，在文件开头添加 `$b2inc = dirname(__FILE__) . '/b2config.php';` 以硬编码配置文件路径，防止通过 URL 参数 `b2inc` 引入远程文件。同时将 `allow_url_include` 和 `allow_url_fopen` 在 php.ini 中设为 Off。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2002-05/0027.html","http://cafelog.com/","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/9013.php","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/4673","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/21436","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/2e429c9a0087eb0ee678d77c344076eb39564d19/cves/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0734.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/37abbcb2a8225ed14d2b9dfffb1ad41b15cc2cc8/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-0734.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-0734","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2002/CVE-2002-0734.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67ac35/nvdcve/CVE-2002-0734.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/e8a327b5fb8f10386ada774358fd16a706ab4c88/2002/CVE-2002-0734.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/67c5e994e49225faeedb88198d627dbdd922374c/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0734.md","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/0d2adc4a9428696b559622523817d9cdfdad97f0/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-07xx/CVE-2002-0734.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0734.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0734.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0407.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0405","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0405.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-0733","title":"ACME Labs thttpd 404错误页面跨站脚本漏洞","description":"ACME Labs thttpd 2.20 及更早版本存在跨站脚本（XSS）漏洞。远程攻击者可通过向目标服务器发送指向不存在页面的特制 URL，触发该漏洞。thttpd 在处理 404 错误页面时未对用户输入进行正确过滤，直接将恶意脚本嵌入错误消息中返回给用户，导致攻击者可在受害者浏览器中执行任意脚本。攻击者无需身份认证，仅需诱使用户访问恶意构造的链接即可实施攻击，可窃取会话 Cookie、重定向页面或执行其他恶意操作。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2002-0733"],"sources":["exploi