AVE-2002-0405.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0404","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0404.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-0732","title":"Levcgi.com MyGuestbook 1.0 跨站脚本注入漏洞","description":"MyGuestbook 1.0 存在跨站脚本（XSS）漏洞，远程攻击者可通过在用户名称或评论等输入字段中注入恶意 HTML 或 JavaScript 代码触发该漏洞，导致受害者在浏览器中执行任意脚本。攻击无需身份认证，利用难度低，可造成信息泄露、会话劫持或页面篡改等危害。该漏洞影响 MyGuestbook 1.0 版本，CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高危。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2002-0732"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2002-08-12T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:58:01Z","remediation":"MyGuestbook 1.0 已停止维护，官方未发布安全补丁。建议立即升级至其他仍在维护的留言板程序（如 Serendipity 或 WordPress 评论系统）。如无法更换，需手动修改 `guestbook.cgi` 源码，对所有用户输入字段（用户名、评论内容等）进行 HTML 实体编码过滤，将 `<` `>` `\"` `'` `&` 替换为 `&lt;` `&gt;` `&quot;` `&#x27;` `&amp;`，并设置 `Content-Type: text/html; charset=utf-8` 防止编码绕过。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2002-04/0422.html","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/8968.php","http://www.levcgi.com/programs.cgi?program=myguestbook&action=history","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/4651","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/21433","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/57d47b7d3f36bb14623bb27ddb073baead1c6714/cves/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0732.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/37abbcb2a8225ed14d2b9dfffb1ad41b15cc2cc8/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-0732.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-0732","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2002/CVE-2002-0732.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67ac35/nvdcve/CVE-2002-0732.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/e615d840f21a506ab4861678584a0f621d55a0d3/2002/CVE-2002-0732.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/67c5e994e49225faeedb88198d627dbdd922374c/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0732.md","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/0d2adc4a9428696b559622523817d9cdfdad97f0/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-07xx/CVE-2002-0732.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0732.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0732.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2002/POC-AVE-2002-0404.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2002/EXP-AVE-2002-0404.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0404.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0402","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0402.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-0731","title":"vqSoft vqServer 演示脚本跨站脚本漏洞","description":"vqSoft vqServer 1.9.x 的演示脚本（如 respond.pl）存在跨站脚本（XSS）漏洞。远程攻击者可通过向演示脚本的参数中注入恶意脚本代码，诱使用户点击特制链接后，在用户浏览器中执行任意脚本，导致敏感信息泄露、会话劫持等危害。攻击无需身份认证，利用方式简单，影响 vqServer 1.9、1.9.30、1.9.47 及 1.9.55 版本。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2002-0731"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2002-08-12T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:58:01Z","remediation":"建议立即删除或禁用 vqServer 自带的演示 CGI 脚本目录（如 `/cgi/vq/demos/`），特别是 `respond.pl` 等未对用户输入做过滤的脚本。如业务需要保留该功能，应在 Web 服务器层面（如反向代理或防火墙）对 CGI 参数进行严格的输入过滤和输出编码，防止恶意脚本注入。由于 vqServer 已停止维护多年，建议迁移至仍受支持的 Web 服务器（如 Apache、Nginx）并重写相关功能。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2002-04/0313.html","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/8935.php","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/4573","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/21411","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/57d47b7d3f36bb14623bb27ddb073baead1c6714/cves/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0731.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/37abbcb2a8225ed14d2b9dfffb1ad41b15cc2cc8/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-0731.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-0731","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2002/CVE-2002-0731.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67ac35/nvdcve/CVE-2002-0731.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/e615d840f21a506ab4861678584a0f621d55a0d3/2002/CVE-2002-0731.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/67c5e994e49225faeedb88198d627dbdd922374c/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0731.md","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/0d2adc4a9428696b559622523817d9cdfdad97f0/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-07xx/CVE-2002-0731.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0731.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0731.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2002/POC-AVE-2002-0402.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2002/EXP-AVE-2002-0402.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0402.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0400","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0400.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-0730","title":"Philip Chinery Guestbook 1.1 跨站脚本攻击漏洞","description":"Philip Chinery's Guestbook 1.1 的 guestbook.pl 存在跨站脚本（XSS）漏洞。远程攻击者可在留言簿的 Name、EMail、Homepage 等输入字段中注入恶意 JavaScript 或 HTML 代码，当管理员或其他用户查看留言时，注入的脚本将在浏览器中执行，导致敏感信息窃取、会话劫持或钓鱼攻击。该漏洞无需身份认证即可利用，攻击复杂度低，影响所有使用该版本的网站。目前已有公开的 ExploitDB 利用代码（ID: 21406）。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2002-0730"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2002-08-12T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:58:01Z","remediation":"该漏洞源于 Philip Chinery's Guestbook 1.1 的 guestbook.pl 脚本未对用户提交的 Name、EMail、Homepage 等字段进行 HTML 转义处理，导致攻击者可注入任意 JavaScript 或 HTML 代码。由于该软件已停止维护，建议立即在 guestbook.pl 中增加输入过滤：对 Name、EMail、Homepage、Text 字段使用 Perl 的 HTML::Entities 模块进行 encode_entities 转义，或使用正则替换 `<` 为 `&lt;`、`>` 为 `&gt;`。更彻底的方案是替换为仍受维护的留言板软件（如 Serendipity 或 WordPress 评论系统），并在 Web 服务器层面启用 Content-Security-Policy 响应头作为纵深防御。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2002-04/0309.html","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/8916.php","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/4566","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/21406","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/57d47b7d3f36bb14623bb27ddb073baead1c6714/cves/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0730.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/37abbcb2a8225ed14d2b9dfffb1ad41b15cc2cc8/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-0730.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-0730","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2002/CVE-2002-0730.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67ac35/nvdcve/CVE-2002-0730.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/e615d840f21a506ab4861678584a0f621d55a0d3/2002/CVE-2002-0730.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/0d2adc4a9428696b559622523817d9cdfdad97f0/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-07xx/CVE-2002-0730.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/67c5e994e49225faeedb88198d627dbdd922374c/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0730.md","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0730.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0730.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2002/POC-AVE-2002-0400.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2002/EXP-AVE-2002-0400.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0400.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0369","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0369.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-0649","title":"Microsoft SQL Server 2000 Resolution Service 堆溢出漏洞","description":"Microsoft SQL Server 2000 及 MSDE 2000 的 Resolution Service 存在堆缓冲区溢出漏洞。该服务监听 UDP 1434 端口，远程攻击者无需认证即可发送特制 UDP 数据包触发溢出：当数据包首字节为 0x04 时，SQL Monitor 线程会生成超长注册表键名导致缓冲区溢出；当首字节为 0x08 时，超长字符串可导致堆破坏。Slammer/Sapphire 蠕虫曾利用此漏洞在全球大规模传播，造成严重网络瘫痪。攻击者成功利用后可导致服务拒绝或远程执行任意代码。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2002-0649"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2002-08-12T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:57:51Z","remediation":"立即安装 Microsoft 安全公告 MS02-039 对应补丁（SQL Server 2000 Service Pack 3 或更高版本），或通过 Windows Update 安装更新。如无法立即打补丁，在防火墙或主机层面阻止 UDP 端口 1434 的入站流量，以阻断 Slammer 蠕虫利用途径。同时建议禁用 SQL Server Resolution Service 或在注册表中将 `SSRPEnabled` 设为 0 以关闭 UDP 监听。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=102760196931518&w=2","http://marc.info/?l=ntbugtraq&m=102760479902411&w=2","http://secunia.com/advisories/7945","http://www.cert.org/advisories/CA-2002-22.html","http://www.cert.org/advisories/CA-2003-04.html","http://www.kb.cert.org/vuls/id/399260","http://www.kb.cert.org/vuls/id/484891","http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/308306/30/26180/threaded","http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/308321/30/26180/threaded","http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/308324/30/26180/threaded","http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/308388/30/26180/threaded","http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/308393/30/26180/threaded","http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/308396/30/26150/threaded","http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/308418/30/26150/threaded","http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/308419/30/26150/threaded","http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/308760/30/26120/threaded","http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/308806/30/26120/threaded","http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/309096/30/26120/threaded","http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/309324/30/26120/threaded","http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/309776/30/26090/threaded","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/5310","https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/security-updates/securitybulletins/2002/ms02-039","https://oval.cisecurity.org/repository/search/definition/oval%3Aorg.mitre.oval%3Adef%3A1077","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/21652","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/7d40e7d94b41c478b4d1a654c7bc3bcf34fa7beb/2002/CVE-2002-0649.md","https://github.com/CVEDB/Poc-Git/blob/0275aeb329b0747c9a1d46160c921eae06095557/2002/CVE-2002-0649.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/81757a559270348b5ed9f7df6d4fbf1e7a4fae68/cves/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0649.json","https://github.com/kaismax/CVE-Poc/blob/6d8c93dabf674cea102713781cc534d577412357/2002/CVE-2002-0649.md","https://github.com/mikaelkall/HackingAllTheThings/blob/f71bfc16484b2e8a980230ef24b5c2489385146d/exploit/windows/remote/CVE-2002-0649_MS02-039_mssql/README.md","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-0649","https://github.com/Ch4120N/Ch4120N-CVE-Pulse/blob/3a751de84316f1f1910c7d0a918a0e2c4180a6d3/CVEs/2002/CVE-2002-0649.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/03a7e425813b5ae0ce33712378801e4e929dbdb7/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-0649.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2002/CVE-2002-0649.md","https://github.com/brenonevs/prs-pentest/blob/001cf17eedeb4aad73618d3140ca1f5dc93e69b3/CVEs & POCs/2002/CVE-2002-0649.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0369.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0363","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0363.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-0644","title":"Microsoft SQL Server 2000 数据库一致性检查器缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"Microsoft SQL Server 2000 及 Microsoft Desktop Engine (MSDE) 2000 的数据库一致性检查器 (DBCC) 存在缓冲区溢出漏洞。具有 db_owner 或 db_ddladmin 数据库角色的用户可通过向 DBCC 命令传递特制参数触发缓冲区溢出，从而在服务器进程中执行任意代码。该漏洞需要攻击者已获得数据库内较高权限，CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高。Microsoft 已在安全更新中修复此漏洞。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2002-0644"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2002-08-12T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:57:51Z","remediation":"立即安装 Microsoft 安全公告 MS02-038 提供的 SQL Server 2000 安全更新补丁，或升级至 SQL Server 2000 Service Pack 3 (SP3) 及以上版本。如无法立即打补丁，应从 db_owner 和 db_ddladmin 角色中移除不必要的用户，并限制 DBCC 命令的执行权限以降低风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/security-updates/securitybulletins/2002/ms02-038","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/21650","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/b160e6f2915ac726b29ee0689fc920f5016abef5/cves/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0644.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/84cdd54c70c68603acd478a90957e5c6d8e65c65/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-0644.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-0644","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2002/CVE-2002-0644.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/9b1777f43cb72006ac01427b6823146d45a3862a/nvdcve/CVE-2002-0644.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/b9f52bb052695dac5cabbd58e049eaac73697161/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-06xx/CVE-2002-0644.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/ec763d1afde14e5e0e8f602252273d336e97634c/2002/CVE-2002-0644.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/aa26e43cea95c9f8fa4c03fce1cced7c702a4035/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0644.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0644.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0644.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0363.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0326","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0326.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-0525","title":"ISC INN 本地格式字符串漏洞","description":"ISC INN (InterNetNews) 2.0/2.1/2.2.x 版本中的 inews 和 rnews 程序存在多个格式字符串漏洞。攻击者可通过构造包含格式字符串说明符（如 %n、%s、%x 等）的恶意 NNTP 响应，诱使 inews 或 rnews 在处理响应时发生格式字符串解析错误，进而实现任意内存读写，最终导致本地权限提升或远程代码执行。该漏洞影响 INN 2.2.3 及更早版本（含 2.0、2.1、2.2.x 系列），攻击向量包括本地用户和远程恶意 NNTP 服务器，攻击复杂度低、无需认证，CVSS 10.0 分（CRITICAL），影响机密性、完整性和可用性。攻击者可通过搭建恶意 NNTP 服务器或本地调用漏洞程序触发漏洞，最终获得系统最高权限。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-2002-0525"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2002-08-12T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:57:36Z","remediation":"建议立即升级 INN (InterNetNews) 至 2.2.4 或更高版本（ISC 官网下载 inn-2.2.4.tar.gz 或更高版本编译安装），或升级至 INN 2.3.x 稳定分支。升级前务必备份 /etc/news/ 等配置目录与文章库。若暂时无法升级，可临时禁用 inews 和 rnews 的 setuid 位（chmod u-s /usr/bin/inews /usr/bin/rnews），并限制 NNTP 服务器仅允许受信 IP 连接（在 /etc/news/innfeed.conf 和 incoming.conf 中配置 peers 白名单），同时在防火墙层面限制 119 端口仅对受信新闻服务器开放，作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-30T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2002-04/0140.html","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/8834.php","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/4501","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/21375","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/09e3a6fe44c91a901bc5c246ef5d5222a6fe5bff/cves/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0525.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/62ba6fb67d4752eaef931a307acc18168885921e/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-0525.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-0525","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2002/CVE-2002-0525.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2002-0525.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/09110e63eff2c5d8130d6d56a8e64068489b359a/2002/CVE-2002-0525.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/ddaa78c50e489d89917c344923ee56bc36e3235e/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0525.md","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/f261edfe26ad788a761a538ae1acc9207c3f30e6/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-05xx/CVE-2002-0525.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0525.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0525.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0326.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0323","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0323.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-0516","title":"SquirrelMail 1.2.x Theme远程命令执行漏洞","description":"SquirrelMail 1.2.5 及更早版本存在远程命令执行漏洞。认证用户可通过修改 HTTP Cookie 中的 THEME 变量注入并执行任意操作系统命令。攻击者无需特殊权限即可利用此漏洞，在目标服务器上执行任意代码，获取完全的系统控制权。该漏洞影响 SquirrelMail 1.2.5 及之前所有版本，CVSS 评分为 10，危害等级为严重。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-2002-0516"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2002-08-12T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:57:35Z","remediation":"建议立即升级 SquirrelMail 至 1.2.6 或更高版本（官方已修复该主题变量注入漏洞）。若暂时无法升级，可在配置文件 config.php 中禁用主题选择功能（$allow_theme_override = false），或在 Web 服务器层面配置拦截包含 THEME 参数的 Cookie 请求作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-30T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2002-03/0350.html","http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2002-03/0386.html","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/8671.php","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/4385","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/21358","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/09e3a6fe44c91a901bc5c246ef5d5222a6fe5bff/cves/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0516.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-0516","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/62ba6fb67d4752eaef931a307acc18168885921e/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-0516.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2002/CVE-2002-0516.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2002-0516.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/7b3c5ee5be30197db078d8e847336c0178ebe3f4/2002/CVE-2002-0516.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/ddaa78c50e489d89917c344923ee56bc36e3235e/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0516.md","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/f261edfe26ad788a761a538ae1acc9207c3f30e6/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-05xx/CVE-2002-0516.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0516.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0516.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2002/POC-AVE-2002-0323.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0323.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0321","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0321.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-0504","title":"Citrix NFuse 跨站脚本攻击漏洞","description":"Citrix NFuse 1.6 及更早版本（含 1.51）的 launch.jsp 和 launch.asp 页面存在跨站脚本漏洞，根因是 getLastError 方法返回结果未进行转义引用，导致攻击者可通过 NFuse_Application 参数注入恶意脚本。远程未认证攻击者可诱导受害者访问构造的恶意链接，在受害者浏览器上下文中执行任意脚本，窃取会话凭证、劫持会话或执行敏感操作。该漏洞影响 Citrix NFuse 1.6 及更早版本，CVSS 7.5（AV:N/AC:L/Au:N/C:P/I:P/A:P），攻击复杂度低、无需认证、网络远程可利用，影响机密性、完整性和可用性。Citrix 已发布补丁修复该漏洞，建议升级至修复版本并启用输出编码防护。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2002-0504"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2002-08-12T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:57:34Z","remediation":"立即升级 Citrix NFuse 至 1.6 之后的最新稳定版本（建议升级至 Citrix NFuse 1.7 或更高版本，从 Citrix 官方下载安全补丁补丁包），在升级前暂时通过 Web 应用防火墙 (WAF) 拦截包含 NFuse_Application 参数的恶意脚本载荷，并在 launch.jsp/launch.asp 中对 getLastError 返回值进行 HTML 实体编码输出以防止 XSS 注入，同时配置 Web 服务器拦截包含 script 标签和事件处理器的请求参数，禁用不必要的 NFuse 功能模块以缩小攻击面。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-30T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2002-03/0334.html","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/8659.php","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/4372","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/21355","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/4d40bbb471811a29843f023fbf1a8beb3373a987/cves/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0504.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/8badb38e9fdd060ee46b7da7005f556b6f7db6bb/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-0504.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-0504","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2002/CVE-2002-0504.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2002-0504.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/28fa1bc56eb946581b4954ed0068b7aeb55be6e9/2002/CVE-2002-0504.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/ddaa78c50e489d89917c344923ee56bc36e3235e/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0504.md","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/f852dcbb0286f5d88b04c17e99702d974cf97496/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-05xx/CVE-2002-0504.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0504.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0504.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2002/POC-AVE-2002-0321.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0321.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0319","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0319.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-0502","title":"Citrix NFuse 1.6 信息泄露漏洞","description":"Citrix NFuse 1.6 版本的 applist.asp 页面存在访问控制缺陷，未进行身份验证即允许远程匿名访问。未经身份认证的远程攻击者可直接访问该页面，枚举并获取已发布应用程序的列表信息，导致敏感应用信息泄露。该漏洞影响 Citrix NFuse 1.6 版本，CVSS 评分 5.0（中等危害），攻击向量为网络，攻击复杂度低，无需认证，仅影响机密性。攻击者无需认证即可通过直接访问 applist.asp 页面获取应用列表信息。Citrix 已发布补丁修复此漏洞，建议升级至修复版本。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2002-0502"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2002-08-12T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:57:34Z","remediation":"建议升级至 Citrix NFuse 1.6 Hotfix 2 (Build 1560) 或更高版本，该补丁修复了 applist.asp 未授权访问漏洞。若无法立即升级，可在 IIS 中为 applist.asp 配置 NTFS 权限仅允许已认证用户访问，或在 IIS URL 授权规则中拒绝匿名访问 /nfuse/applist.asp 路径，同时在防火墙层面限制外部直接访问 NFuse 发布站点的管理页面路径。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-30T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/251737","http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/251923","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/3926","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/7984","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/21235","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/4d40bbb471811a29843f023fbf1a8beb3373a987/cves/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0502.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/8badb38e9fdd060ee46b7da7005f556b6f7db6bb/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-0502.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-0502","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2002/CVE-2002-0502.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2002-0502.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/a91b5761c0d412dd56f3e255388077228a3d8a70/2002/CVE-2002-0502.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/f852dcbb0286f5d88b04c17e99702d974cf97496/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-05xx/CVE-2002-0502.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/ddaa78c50e489d89917c344923ee56bc36e3235e/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0502.md","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0502.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0502.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2002/POC-AVE-2002-0319.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0319.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0318","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0318.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-0499","title":"Linux Kernel Linux Kernel 2.2.x/2.3/2.4.x d_path() 路径截断漏洞","description":"Linux 内核 2.2.x/2.3/2.4.x 版本中的 d_path() 函数存在路径截断漏洞。该函数在处理过长路径名时会直接截断而不返回错误，导致路径解析结果不准确。本地攻击者可通过构造超长路径名，诱使程序基于截断后的错误路径执行文件操作，导致程序在错误目录上执行非预期操作，破坏文件系统完整性。该漏洞影响 Linux 内核 2.2.20 及更早版本、2.4.18 及更早版本，CVSS 评分 2.1（本地访问、低复杂度、无需认证、部分完整性影响），属于本地权限提升/完整性破坏类漏洞。攻击者需具备本地系统访问权限，通过构造超长路径诱导受影响程序（如 setuid 程序）操作错误目录实现利用。Linux 内核社区已在后续版本中修复该路径截断问题。","severity":"LOW","score":2.1,"aliases":["CVE-2002-0499"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2002-08-12T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:57:33Z","remediation":"建议立即升级 Linux 内核至 2.2.21 或 2.4.19 及以上版本，或从 kernel.org 下载并应用官方补丁修复 d_path() 路径截断漏洞。如暂时无法升级内核，请严格限制本地非特权用户登录权限，并通过访问控制列表（ACL）限制关键目录访问权限作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-30T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/vulnwatch/2002-q1/0074.html","http://www.cs.helsinki.fi/linux/linux-kernel/2002-13/0054.html","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/8634.php","http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/264117","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/4367","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/21353","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/4d40bbb471811a29843f023fbf1a8beb3373a987/cves/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0499.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-0499","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/8badb38e9fdd060ee46b7da7005f556b6f7db6bb/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-0499.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/3e6ed1a1d75816367e38c59309d8bdc19a3733f1/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0499.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2002/CVE-2002-0499.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2002-0499.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0499.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/d226694fb3655325d703aa542069be1356d5a679/2002/CVE-2002-0499.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/1811750a5b6a37290aff484954f5ab77b0ca64a7/content/CVE-2002-0499.md","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/f852dcbb0286f5d88b04c17e99702d974cf97496/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-04xx/CVE-2002-0499.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0318.toml"}]